<title>USA: Mitchell Energy Q4 oper net higher.</title>
<headline>Mitchell Energy Q4 oper net higher.</headline>
<dateline>THE WOODLANDS, Texas 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Oper Shr profit	  $0.78   profit	 $0.07</p>
<p> Shr profit		  0.78     loss	  0.83</p>
<p> Oper Net profit	 40,300   profit	 3,500</p>
<p> Net profit		40,260     loss	43,015</p>
<p> Revs		     380,979		  245,678</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  51,828		   52,045</p>
<p>12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Oper Shr profit	  $1.97   profit	 $0.83</p>
<p> Shr profit		  1.99   profit	  0.71</p>
<p> Oper Net profit	102,000   profit	43,300</p>
<p> Net profit	     103,226   profit	37,129</p>
<p> Revs		   1,104,844		1,071,747</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  51,878		   52,044</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>NOTE: Full company name is Mitchell Energy &amp; Development Corp.</p>
<p>Q4 1996 net includes charges totaling $74.4 million from litigation provision, write-downs of real estate properties, and asset write-downs.</p>
<p>1997 year net includes gain of $1.9 million from gains from sales of non-Woodlands real estate, Columbia Gas contract settlement proceeds, severance tax refunds, and litigation provision.</p>
<p>1996 year net includes charges of $3.9 million from write-down of real estate, asset write-downs, personnel reduction program costs, litigation provision, gains from sales of producing properties and drilling rigs, and gain from a natural gas contract buyout.</p>
</text>
